            "review_text": "Robbo44Melbourne\nMelbourne, Australia282 contributions\n0\nMainly Locals\nMay 2019 • Couples\nThis buffet on the roof of the hotel is a well kept secret. It is advisable to book as it gets quite busy. We were staying at the hotel so they did it for us when we arrived. It's only on at the weekends. There is a large variety of food on offer and it is very good value. I would certainly go back on our next visit.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 8, 2019",
