            "review_title": "Review at Huong Sen Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Zvikagol\nTel Aviv, Israel766 contributions\n0\nGreat buffet hidden from tourists\nOct 2017 • Couples\nOnly by mistake that we found this rooftop buffet in the middle of Ho Chi min city. No one takes us about it and it wasn't on TripAdvisor until I asked them to ad this location as a restaurant.\n\nIn the rooftop of a 3 stars hotel only on weekends you can eat a lovely and welcoming buffet with lots of local dishes including the most popular street food you see all around you but you don't dear to eat due to hygiene issues- so now you can!\n\nWe payed less then 400 k dong ( about usd 15$) and enjoyed two hours of tasty food including also sushi, fresh sea food and more!\n\nLocated on the rooftop of the hotel , only on the weekends ( Thur - sun) you can find a rich buffet for a very good price and I quite tasty food\n\nFor half the price of the average high rated buffets in town this solid place stands proudly and serves mainly locals that know about it and enjoys the relatively large verity for a really low price.\n\nThe hotel that the restaurant is on its rooftop is next to the main city attractions and can fit in to every tourist's plan again, only on weekends..\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 28, 2017",
